diff -Nru ubuntu-unity-meta-0.29/debian/changelog ubuntu-unity-meta-0.29+unity1/debian/changelog
--- ubuntu-unity-meta-0.29/debian/changelog	2026-04-16 20:28:25.000000000 +0000
+++ ubuntu-unity-meta-0.29+unity1/debian/changelog	2026-09-26 18:01:35.000000000 +0000
@@ -1,3 +1,15 @@
+ubuntu-unity-meta (0.29+unity1) resolute; urgency=medium
+
+  * desktop-recommends: drop overlay-scrollbar-gtk2. Its GTK 2 module is
+    dead (it needs a GTK 2 patch Ubuntu dropped) and its session script put
+    it into GTK2_MODULES, breaking GTK 2 applications; overlay-scrollbar
+    +unity1 removes both on upgrade.
+  * desktop-recommends: add ayatana-indicator-messages, the messaging menu
+    26.04's clients (Geary, Pidgin, ...) talk to; Unity's panel shows it
+    with libindicator +unity2.
+
+ -- Ubuntu Unity Life Support <mihail.rozshko@gmail.com>  Sat, 26 Sep 2026 18:01:35 +0000
+
 ubuntu-unity-meta (0.29) resolute; urgency=medium
 
   * Replace gnome-screensaver with light-locker (LP: #2097151)
